frontlet_data:calais_death_345 a frontlet:Death,
        frontlet:IndividualEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Death event 345"@en ;
    frontlet:hasComment "Ahmed Abdallah, a 17-year-old, was crushed to death by the bus he had hidden on from Boulogne to England as he tried to leave his hiding place. His brother Jamal was wating for him in London."@en,
        "Ahmed Abdallah, 17 ans, a réussi de se cacher dans un bus à Boulogne. Il est bien arrivé en Angleterre, mais lorsqu'il a essayé de sortir de sa cachette, le bus l'a écrasé. Son frère Jamal l'attendait à Londres."@fr ;
