    rdfs:label "Collective event 23"@en ;
    frontlet:hasComment "39 people  were found dead in the back of a refrigerated truck in Waterglade Industrial Park in Grays, Essex (GB). The victims, 8 women and 31 men, were all originally from north east Vietnam, and died of suffocation during their attempt to cross the border hidden in the truck."@en,
        "39 people were found dead in the back of a refrigerated truck in Waterglade Industrial Park in Grays, Essex (GB). The victims, 8 women and 31 men, were all originally from north east Vietnam and died of suffocation during their attempt to cross the border hidden in the truck."@en,
        "39 personnes ont été retrouvées mortes dans un conteneur remorque dans la zone industrielle du Waterglade Industrial Park, à Grays, Essex (GB). Les victimes, parmi lesquelles on compte 8 femmes et 31 hommes, sont toutes originaires du nord-est du Vietnam. Elles sont mortes asphyxiées pendant leur tentative de franchissement de la frontière alors qu'elles étaient cachées dans ce conteneur."@fr ;
